      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file that retrieves aggregated statistics for a metric over a time window using a concrete external provider, I will choose Google Analytics as the provider. Google Analytics is a widely used service for tracking and reporting website traffic, and it provides APIs for retrieving various statistics. I will use the Google Analytics Reporting API to fetch the required data. </thinking>\n",
